-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח ג'2: the work-week table of a
-- teacher in the reform's part application in תשע"ג (§26(ב) sends a
-- part-time teacher to it); the 60-minute hour of its presence; its notes
-- on frontal hours that are not whole and on fewer than 4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`

§ `נספח ג'2`

-- The title ("טבלאות שבוע עבודה למורים ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה בשנת
-- הלימודים תשע"ג") and the table: a teacher in the part application in
-- תשע"ג, from the full position §26(א) composes for the year (24 frontal,
-- 3 individual and 5 teaching-support hours, as §26 holds it) down to 6
-- frontal hours, a frontal hour less a column.
@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/p1 akn:att_11__hc_1/t1
`the table of annex ג'2` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח ג'2"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band under 50`
        `what it is for`         IS `the week by the position`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 24 3 5 32,
            `an Oz annexed column` (95.31%) 23 3 4.5 30.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (92.19%) 22 3 4.5 29.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (85.94%) 21 2.5 4 27.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (82.81%) 20 2.5 4 26.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (78.13%) 19 2.5 3.5 25,
            `an Oz annexed column` (75.00%) 18 2.5 3.5 24,
            `an Oz annexed column` (70.31%) 17 2 3.5 22.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (67.19%) 16 2 3.5 21.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (62.50%) 15 2 3 20,
            `an Oz annexed column` (57.81%) 14 1.5 3 18.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (53.13%) 13 1.5 2.5 17,
            `an Oz annexed column` (50.00%) 12 1.5 2.5 16,
            `an Oz annexed column` (45.31%) 11 1.5 2 14.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (42.19%) 10 1.5 2 13.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (35.94%) 9 1 1.5 11.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (32.81%) 8 1 1.5 10.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (26.56%) 7 0.5 1 8.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (23.44%) 6 0.5 1 7.5

-- The asterisk under the table: the presence is in hours of 60 minutes
-- (§26(י), as §9(יא)), which changes nothing in the length of a teaching
-- period as the Ministry of Education set it.
@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/p2
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz annexed column`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of presence a column of annex ג'2 asks` c IS
    `the minutes of weekly presence` (`the annexed column's week` c)

`the presence in annex ג'2 changes the length of a teaching period` MEANS FALSE

-- The first note: frontal and role hours that are not whole take the
-- individual and support hours of the column nearest to them, and the
-- position is all the hours over the full position's (common: `the week
-- the annexed table gives`, `the position of the week in the annexed
-- table`).
@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/p3
GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what the table of annex ג'2 gives for` f IS
    `what the annexed table gives for` `the table of annex ג'2` f

-- The second note: a teacher with fewer than 4 frontal hours (with his
-- homeroom and role hours) works frontal hours only, his position his
-- hours over "בסיס המשרה ברפורמה ביישום חלקי בשנת הלימודים תשע"ג" — the
-- year's full position under §26(א), the table's own. "בפחות מ-4" leaves 4
-- out.
@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/p4
`the fewest frontal hours annex ג'2 keeps whole` MEANS 4

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER @desc frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex ג'2 gives a teacher with` f IS
    `what the annexed table gives, frontal hours only below` `the table of annex ג'2` `the fewest frontal hours annex ג'2 keeps whole` f

§§ `נספח ג'2 -- the checks`

-- The table opens at the full position, its columns step down a frontal
-- hour at a time, and its arithmetic holds in every cell: each presence is
-- its column's hours, each position its hours over the 32.
#ASSERT `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the table of annex ג'2`
#ASSERT `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the table of annex ג'2`
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ג'2` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ג'2` EQUALS 6

§§ `נספח ג'2 -- illustrations`

-- 23 frontal hours: the second column, 95.31%; 3 frontal hours: frontal
-- hours only, 3 of 32.
#ASSERT `what annex ג'2 gives a teacher with` 23 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 23 3 4.5) (95.31%) (95.31%))
#ASSERT `what annex ג'2 gives a teacher with` 3 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 3 0 0) (3 DIVIDED BY 32) (3 DIVIDED BY 32))
#ASSERT NOT `the presence in annex ג'2 changes the length of a teaching period`
